B1 (q = 5): per-clock statistics, p <= 24, clocks with C(p,a) >= 50 printed (s = sign of G: + dyadic, - 5-adic)
  amp = max(2^p, q^a)/|G| (distance to the critical line); Coll-C = excess coincident pairs;
  C(C-1)/M = its uniform-model mean; lam.d = #{|x|>=1/2, ||x|| <= d}/(2 d C); elig = share of words
  whose rational cycle has least point >= 1; maxS/C = max_{h!=0}|S(h)|/C (FFT) or max over Sigma_3
  (dp); mU/rt = max over h outside Sigma_3 (FFT) or over 1000 random h (dp), divided by sqrt(C ln M);
  Estr = share of the energy sum_{h!=0}|S(h)|^2 carried by Sigma_3.
