  refined = exact eligible counts (p <= 30), the proven classes 'none'/'all', and Monte Carlo on the
  transition band next to the critical line (p <= 1000; each band stops after two consecutive clocks
  with no eligible sample).  Transition clocks outside the sampled band carry naive weight dyadic
  2.0399, q-adic 0.0000; they are counted as 0 (their Monte Carlo share is 0 at the
  band edge and the eligible share decreases away from the critical line).
