==============================================================================================================
C3. Bound hierarchy (log2 values).  N(p,a) = number of integral words on the clock.
  size   = log2((c_max - c_min)/|G| + 1)   [injectivity of w -> x_w + range of c_w]
  perig  = log2(p * (1/|2^(p/a) - 3|/2 + 1))  [distinct odd least points <= 1/|2^(p/a)-3|; Belaga 2003]
  sqrtC  = log2 sqrt(C)   [no second-moment (Parseval) bound can certify less than ~ sqrt(C - C^2/M)]
  main   = log2 C/|G|
==============================================================================================================
           (p,a)   log2|G|    log2 C     sqrtC      size   perig      main
