  coarse moduli (all words, p <= 14): c_w = w_0 mod 2, and c_w = 2^(s_{a-1}) != 0 mod q; so the carries are
  never equidistributed mod 2 or mod q (the Tao-type coarse irregularity), while every modulus coprime to 2q
  is reached at the proven exponential rate.

